SUMMARY:Group Fitness - Spin the Beat
LOCATION:Studio - Cycle
DESCRIPTION:An invigorating indoor cycling class that aligns your pedal strokes with the beat of high-energy music. This class emphasizes coordination\, with music specifically chosen to challenge your endurance and strength\, providing a motivating ride that keeps you in sync. Experience the thrill of riding to the beat in a group setting!
